   "versionNonce": 2039219967,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1730000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Colors: blue = users, green = leagues/contests/teams/tournaments, orange = membership and participation, purple = money, gray = system\nPK = primary key   FK = foreign key   UQ = unique   * = standalone contests only\nNot drawn: user_id foreign keys from contest_participants, payouts, settlement_rows; contest_id from payouts, audit_log, contest_participants;\n           league_id from settlement_rows, audit_log. Composite keys: contests (tournament_id, team) -> tournament_teams, contests (league_id, tournament_id) -> leagues.\nNo cascading deletes. Rows change status instead (VOID, REMOVED, CANCELLED, is_active = false).\nLeague contests: result is written on contest_participants and netted at league end in settlement_rows. Standalone contests also create payouts.\nNo stored totals: P/L, balances and stats are calculated from contest_participants. shedlock (job lock table) is skipped in V1.",
   "originalText": "Colors: blue = users, green = leagues/contests/teams/tournaments, orange = membership and participation, purple = money, gray = system\nPK = primary key   FK = foreign key   UQ = unique   * = standalone contests only\nNot drawn: user_id foreign keys from contest_participants, payouts, settlement_rows; contest_id from payouts, audit_log, contest_participants;\n           league_id from settlement_rows, audit_log. Composite keys: contests (tournament_id, team) -> tournament_teams, contests (league_id, tournament_id) -> leagues.\nNo cascading deletes. Rows change status instead (VOID, REMOVED, CANCELLED, is_active = false).\nLeague contests: result is written on contest_participants and netted at league end in settlement_rows. Standalone contests also create payouts.\nNo stored totals: P/L, balances and stats are calculated from contest_participants. shedlock (job lock table) is skipped in V1.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
 ],
